{"level":20,"time":"2026-05-02T09:31:33.885Z","pid":1,"hostname":"8b756e0ee086","name":"CvEmbeddingsService","msg":"Parsed CV: {\"summary\":\"I am a software developer with over 10 years of experience in the software development industry. I am currently focused on the backend technologies, but in the past I've worked as a full stack developer as well. I have experiences with lots of different technologies around Java and Node.js web ecosystems. I also teach various IT courses for a Czech NGO Czechitas (e.g. JavaScript, React, testing, SQL). I've studied the University of Economics in Prague and therefore I have background in economics and finance as well. I speak fluently Czech, English and Vietnamese. I also have basic knowledge of German as I lived in Munich, Germany for 6 years.\",\"skills\":[\"TypeScript\",\"Node.js\",\"Java\",\"Spring Boot\",\"Spring\",\"Spring Security\",\"Spring Data\",\"Spring Batch\",\"RabbitMQ\",\"PostgresSQL\",\"Docker\",\"Github Actions\",\"Scrum\",\"k8s\",\"OpenTelemetry\",\"Vector.dev\",\"LangChain\",\"LangGraph\",\"Next.js\",\"React\",\"Nest.js\",\"JUnit\",\"Adyen\",\"PayPal Plus\",\"Node.js\",\"hapi.dev\",\"Selenium\",\"JQuery\",\"AngularJS\",\"Protobuf\",\"Hibernate\",\"SQL\",\"JavaScript\",\"Grails\"],\"experience\":[\"IP Fabric, Inc. - Senior Backend Developer: I helped the team implement new customer-requested features and contributed to resolving security issues that enabled the company to acquire new clients. Besides programming, I also communicated with other teams to complete my tasks effectively.\",\"commercetools GmbH - Software Developer: I participated in the development of e-commerce systems for various customers (e.g. AUDI, Carhartt), mainly as a backend developer. Later I moved to a new team that develops tooling for the platform. My main focus was Java and JavaScript SDKs and a new observability tool. I also interviewed and helped new developers with their tasks.\",\"Tradesports.com - Software Developer: I helped developing and maintaining a new trading platform.\"],\"projects\":[\"commercetools adyen integration - node.js: Integration between commercetools platform and adyen payment platform\",\"commercetools typescript SDK - node.js: TypeScript SDK for commercetools platform\",\"ara.cz - Grails: Web page for travellers\"],\"education\":[\"University of Economics in Prague - Master degree in Informational systems and technologies\",\"University of Queensland, Brisbane - Exchange student for one semester\"],\"other\":[]}"}
